package telemetry

namespace telemetry:
    refer wire

    system collector1, collector2, station
    environment network

    [STATION] There is a station.
    [CLASS] The station is a telemetry service that is also a monitoring service.
    [MEMBER] The station is a member of the network.
    [QUEUE] The station has exactly one queue.
    [STORE] The station shall store a report.

    A monitored service means a telemetry service that is a monitoring service.
    A monitored endpoint means a monitored service.

    [START] While the station is a monitored endpoint, the station shall log a summary.

    [FIRST] There is a collector1.
    [SECOND] There is a collector2.
    [RECEIPT] There is a receipt.
    apply wire as north with endpoint = collector1, reply = receipt
    apply wire as south with endpoint = collector2, reply = receipt
